      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "RICHARD.\nThe Queen is valued thirty thousand strong,\nAnd Somerset, with Oxford, fled to her.\nIf she have time to breathe, be well assured\nHer faction will be full as strong as ours.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
